Examples of cuFINUFFT usage in C and C++

Each is built and run as a test (ctest -R example_) and exits nonzero on an
error, NaN or Inf, or accuracy failure.

getting_started.c      1D type 1, single precision, guru (plan) interface, in C (the docs walkthrough)
simple1d1.cu           1D type 1, simple interface, double precision
simple1d1f.cu          1D type 1, simple interface, single precision
simple2d1.cu           2D type 1, simple interface
many1d1.cu             1D type 1, simple interface, many transforms with the same points
guru1d1.cu             1D type 1, guru (plan) interface, double precision
guru1d1f.cu            1D type 1, guru (plan) interface, single precision
guru2d1.cu             2D type 1, guru (plan) interface
gurumany1d1.cu         1D type 1, guru (plan) interface, many transforms with the same points
example2d1many.cu      2D type 1, many transforms with the same points, single precision
example2d2many.cu      2D type 2, many transforms with the same points, double precision
example2d3many.cu      2D type 3, many transforms with the same points, double precision
simulplans1d1.cu       1D type 1, two plans alive at once
spreadinterponly1d.cu  1D spread-only and interpolate-only (gpu_spreadinterponly) tasks
threadsafe1d1.cu       1D type 1, one plan and CUDA stream per thread
threadsafe2d2f.cu      2D type 2, single precision, one plan and CUDA stream per thread

For more usage examples see:

../test/cuda/cufinufft*.cu
../python/cufinufft/tests/*.py

To compile getting_started.c by hand from this directory, run

    nvcc -o getting_started getting_started.c -lcufinufft

If the library is not installed in the standard directories, set the paths first:

    export CPATH="${CPATH:+${CPATH}:}../../include"
    export LIBRARY_PATH="${LIBRARY_PATH:+${LIBRARY_PATH}:}../../build"
    export LD_LIBRARY_PATH="${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+${LD_LIBRARY_PATH}:}../../build"

Then run ./getting_started.
